# owneetd runs as a user service of the console user (not root): docs/daemon-design.md
[Unit]
Description=OwneetOS system daemon
Documentation=https://github.com/fancy-dino/OwneetOS/blob/main/docs/daemon-design.md

[Service]
ExecStart=/usr/bin/owneetd
Restart=on-failure
RestartSec=1
NoNewPrivileges=yes

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
